{1220}{Rules choice.Molochean Hand}
{1221}{You are told about a placed filled with danger, treasure and spiders. Rumors are that the villagers were experimenting with spiders for commercial gain and suffered the wrath of Moorindal, the pagan god of evil}
{1222}{Rumor is that a small trading post exists there.}
{1223}{The old destroyed Village of Vaselan is located there. Rumors exist that a powerful artifact can be found there. Rumors insist that this artifact could be very useful for summoners.}
{1224}{Rumor is that in that location a house of Darkness exists. In the basement there is a huge dungeon. Rumors talk about a necromancer's cult that was cursed by Moorindal, the pagan god of evil, because he feared that their experiments would make them too dangerous and a threat to his godhood. Proceed with extreme caution.}
{1225}{Half-orc village. Unless you are a half-orc or and orc you will be attacked there on sight.}
{1226}{The unnamed stuff. There are rumors that this is the resting place of the unnamed stuff an item with wondrous powers. It is rumored that golems guard this place.}
{1227}{Strange things are happening there. Unconfirmed rumors speak about deadly sheep that are not really sheep.}
{1228}{Undead city. It is rumored that in this village decent traders who were just charging a little more than necessary were condemned to suffer an eternal life as undead. Outrageous.}
{1229}{Rumor is that an old abandoned prison exists there. Rumor is that a very evil necromancer couple kills anybody that comes close and uses their bodies for evil experiments. Rumor is that the woman possesses the legendary lava chakram}
{1230}{Rumor is that a small woodcutters village has been recently destroyed by an attack from undead. Rumor is that the undead attack has something to do with a strange portal that appeared just before the attack in Shadygrove cemetery.}
{1231}{Sherwood forest. Rumor is that a dangerous fraudster has stolen a fortune from a lot of people by using their greed against them lives there. It is rumored his gang attacks on sight any unlucky person that might have the misfortune of approaching them.}
{1232}{Because you have dealt with the Assassin village inhabitants you have earned the friendship of the Wilderness Merchants guild members. You will find that they like you a lot more and they are willing to sell to you a wider selection of items.}
{1233}{Rules choice. The death spirits of the creatures that you have killed will not scale with player level.}
{1234}{Rules choice. The death spirits of the creatures that you have killed will scale with player level.}
{1235}{You seem to be the owner of a strange new artifact, "the car" .People of the larger cities of Arcanum  seem to notice you and react more favorably to you.}
{1236}{The car is really a very old human female that was transformed in this shape as part of a failed ancient ritual intended to transform her to an elf. She believes that you can take her to a place beyond Arcanum. Only in such a place will the spell break.}
{1237}{If the spell that has transformed Ramona to a car ever breaks then everything in the car inventory will be destroyed and will be replaced by the items that Ramona was carrying before the ritual.}
{1238}{While the Car is with you, your party will be able to avoid encounters with most of the monsters that plague Arcanum in the world map. If you feel the need to cleanse Arcanum of some of those monsters you should try to leave the car behind for a while. However you may find that leaving the car behind is a difficult thing to do. It may be wise to tell the car to wait only while your party is in the main deck of the ship.}
{1239}{Rules choice.Bonus to your electrical , fire and damage resistance 24%.}
{1240}{Rules choice.Bonus to your electrical , fire and damage resistance 27%.}
{1241}{Rules choice.Bonus to your electrical , fire and damage resistance 29%.}
{1242}{You are a sexist. You believe that your own sex is superior than the other. In order to find arguments to support your extreme thesis you have developed your intellect, gaining +1 to intelligence. However, people mistrust your extreme views. This slightly lowers others' reaction to you in all large towns in Arcanum.} 
{1243}{You are a religious person. The people of Caladon--a Panarii stronghold--react more favourably to you. This increases their reaction to you. Similarly, the people of Dernholm, having found religion to fill the gap in their poverty-stricken lives, also have increased reactions to you. However the people of the cosmopolitan city of Tarant mistrust you for your supposed extreme religious views. This lowers their reaction to you.} 
{1244}{You are considered a progressive radical person. Not only you believe that man and woman are equal in all respects but you also believe that man and woman should not stick to their predefined society rules but should do whatever their heart desires .You are despised by the patriarchal society of Tarant and similarly by the Matriarchal society in Elves settlements Without some strong aesthetic appeal, you may be attacked on sight in these areas. However your views attract to you other persons like you. Your charisma is increased by 1} 
{1245}{You are a traditionalist. You believe that men and women should stick to their role as defined by society. in most situations your views are neither advantageous nor a detriment.} 
{1246}{You've never been interested in men and have habitually sought...companionship in female arms. Although Arcanum is moving forwards socially, there remain conservative elements from which you decide to keep your... preference a secret. You've spent much of your life blending in with others and convincing them that you're perfectly normal, earning a 4/4 bonus to persuasion. However, you cannot fool everyone and people tend to frown at you. You suffer a significant negative reaction penalty in all the large cities of Arcanum except Tarant. Without some strong aesthetic appeal, you may be attacked on sight in these areas} 
{1247}{Your preferences lean towards those of your own sex. Fortunately, you've managed to keep this quiet. Your sense of style is far more developed than in other men. You gain 2 points of beauty. Your health, however, has suffered as a result of your lifestyle. You lose 3 points of constitution.}
{1248}{Special Elite Class Package. Arcane Master. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great mage. You start the game with 40 more fatigue and 4 more points to willpower}
{1249}{Special Elite Class Package. Summoner. Most of your summons have +3 to dex and +3 to st.}
{1250}{Special Elite Class Package .Doctor. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great doctor. You start the game with +4 to your intelligence +8/4 to doctor and you get a better reaction +15 to all Arcanum big cities.}
{1251}{Special Elite Class Package. Gambler .From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great gambler .You start the game with +4 to your intelligence +8/4 to gambling and +10 % chance to make critical hits with both melee and ranged weapons when you hit.}
{1252}{Special Elite Class Package. Bruiser. You hit much harder with all melee weapons. You gain +10 damage bonus with all melee weapons.}
{1253}{Special Elite Class Package. Gladiator .From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great fighter. You gain +5 to dexterity +5/4 to both melee weapons and dodge.}
{1254}{Special Elite Class Package. Merchant. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great merchant. You gain +4 to intelligence +8/4 to haggle and you start the game with 8 white diamonds. You also enjoy a better standing with all the wilderness traders +30}
{1255}{Special Elite Class Package. Gunner. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great Gunner. You gain +4 to perception +8/4 to guns and you start the game with a black diamond .You need the black diamond to make the top of the line gun the Warbringer.}
{1256}{Special Elite Class Package. Technologist. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great technologist. You start the game with +4 to intelligence  4 random schematics and a charged ring .You also much more popular in Tarrant the great technological city  +40 reaction in Tarrant.}
{1257}{Special Elite Class Package. Thief. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great Thief. You start the game with +4 to dexterity and +4/4 to pickpocket , +4/4 to locksmith +4/4 to detect traps and +4/4 to disable traps.}
{1258}{Special Elite Class Package. Ninja. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a Ninja Silent Killer. You start the game with +2 to perception and +5/4 to prowling .You also gain +2 to dexterity and +5/4 to backstab. You also start the game with a fine dagger.}
{1259}{Special Elite Class Package. Diplomat. From very young in your life you felt the need to become a great diplomatat. You start the game with +4 to charisma and +4/4 to persuasion and +2 to beauty.}